<title>UZBEKISTAN: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CAMBODIA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CAMBODIA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan beat Cambodia 6-0</p>
<p>(halftime 4-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group five</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Nikolai Shirshov 5, Nugman Khasanov 15, Sergei</p>
<p>Lebedev 36, 75, Andrei Fyodorov 43, Dzhafar Irismetov 59</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>    Standings		P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Yemen			 4   2   1   1   8   1   7</p>
<p> Uzbekistan		  2   2   0   0   7   0   6</p>
<p> Indonesia		   3   1   2   0   9   1   5</p>
<p> Cambodia		    5   0   1   4   1  23   1</p>
<p>Note: Group winners qualify for second round</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 1 Indonesia v Uzbekistan, June 13</p>
<p>Yemen v Indonesia, June 20 Uzbekistan v Indonesia, June 29</p>
<p>Cambodia v Uzbekistan, July 13 Uzbekistan v Yemen</p>
</text>
